{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45368","headline":"晨登乐游原望终南积雪 · 皎然","name":"晨登乐游原望终南积雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凌晨拥弊裘，径上古原头。\n雪霁山疑近，天高思若浮。\n琼峰埋积翠，玉嶂掩飞流。\n曜彩含朝日，摇光夺寸眸。\n寒空标瑞色，爽气袭皇州。\n清眺何人得，终当独再游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}